'''Ambush''' is a precept [[mod]] for {{Companion|Shade}}, {{Companion|Prisma Shade}}, and {{Companion|Shade Prime}} that temporarily buffs the owner's weapon [[damage]] after breaking invisibility granted by {{M|Ghost}}.

